      "writtenOn": "2020-12-15T16:33:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The sip code of the retry-after are defined in the rfc3261 section \"20.33 Retry-After\"\n404 (Not Found)\n413 (Request Entity Too Large)\n480 (Temporarily Unavailable)\n486 (Busy Here)\n600 (Busy)\n603 (Decline)\n\nHowever, according to https://b.corp.google.com/issues/171939076#comment4, vendor will handle the publish retry.\nIt seems that framework doesn\u0027t handle the retry case.",
